A Week Away is a drama, music, romance film directed by Roman White.

2
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:36,000
Troubled teen Will Hawkins has a run-in with the law that puts him at an important
crossroad: go to juvenile detention or attend a Christian summer camp.

3
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:21,000
At first a fish-out-of-water, Will opens his heart, discovers love with a camp
regular, and sense of belonging in the last place he expected to find it.

